  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RoadOfTheOldKing.World.ForgeInscription
  siteNumber: 2
  heading: THE PATIENT HEAT
  inscriptionText: 'Beneath the hammer-mark, careful grooves cross a blackened sun-wheel.


    Heat
    the heart before the edge. Turn the work until no face is cold. The impatient
    smith burns away what he means to strengthen.


    Below, a later hand has cut:
    The King''s men asked only how bright it would burn.'
  requiredMilestone: 
